      "text": "Invariants:\n- terminal state is immutable\n- user decision only in AWAITING_USER_DECISION\n- target_document_id must be one of duplicate_candidate_ids\n- decision must be made before deadline\n- COMPLETED requires both result IDs\n- knowledge_base_id is immutable\n- requested_by_user_id is immutable",
