      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- document_id is immutable\n- created_from_addition_id is immutable\n- content artifacts are immutable\n- fingerprints are immutable\n- content cannot be replaced in an existing version\n- changing content requires creating a new DocumentVersion\n- only REGISTERED version can become SEARCHABLE\n- only REGISTERED version can become\nPROCESSING_FAILED\n- created_by_user_id is immutable",
      "fontSize": 25.954457238342506,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- document_id is immutable\n- created_from_addition_id is immutable\n- content artifacts are immutable\n- fingerprints are immutable\n- content cannot be replaced in an existing version\n- changing content requires creating a new DocumentVersion\n- only REGISTERED version can become SEARCHABLE\n- only REGISTERED version can become PROCESSING_FAILED\n- created_by_user_id is immutable",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
