      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786441903717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- input snapshot is immutable\n- processing configuration is immutable after start\n- terminal state is immutable\n- EMBEDDING requires chunk_manifest_id\n- WAITING_FOR_RETRIEVAL requires\nembedding_manifest_id\n- COMPLETED requires retrieval_projection_id\n- retry does not move the process to an earlier stage",
      "fontSize": 19.17319116520545,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- input snapshot is immutable\n- processing configuration is immutable after start\n- terminal state is immutable\n- EMBEDDING requires chunk_manifest_id\n- WAITING_FOR_RETRIEVAL requires embedding_manifest_id\n- COMPLETED requires retrieval_projection_id\n- retry does not move the process to an earlier stage",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
