      "seed": 2119101866,
      "version": 987,
      "versionNonce": 2049273142,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786443491296,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- input snapshot is immutable\n- vector configuration is immutable after indexing starts\n- INDEXING requires embedding_manifest_id\n- only INDEXED projection can be activated\n- only ACTIVE projection can be retired\n- only RETIRED projection can be deleted\n- deletion requires delete_after <= now\n- DELETED and FAILED are terminal\n- retry does not move lifecycle backwards\n- INDEXED requires vector_index_ref\n- RETIRED requires cleanup_status SCHEDULED or\nREQUIRED\n- DELETED requires cleanup_status COMPLETED",
      "fontSize": 18.956240342333544,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- input snapshot is immutable\n- vector configuration is immutable after indexing starts\n- INDEXING requires embedding_manifest_id\n- only INDEXED projection can be activated\n- only ACTIVE projection can be retired\n- only RETIRED projection can be deleted\n- deletion requires delete_after <= now\n- DELETED and FAILED are terminal\n- retry does not move lifecycle backwards\n- INDEXED requires vector_index_ref\n- RETIRED requires cleanup_status SCHEDULED or REQUIRED\n- DELETED requires cleanup_status COMPLETED",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
